{
  "about": "Routie test questions. scripts/test-routie.mjs sends each q to resolveRoutieContext (no AI model, no network, no Firestore) and checks what comes back. expect: type = context type or list of allowed types; faq = FAQ id; notFaq = FAQ ids that must NOT answer; place = slug in server/data/places.json (checked against data.name); lang = 'en' or 'tl'; contains / notContains = text (case-insensitive) in directReply or instruction. Tags: faq, faq-new, regression (wrong today), place, alias, ambiguous, route, fare, scope, smalltalk, lang.",
